            // About
            section#about.resume-section
                .resume-section-content
                    h1.mb-0
                        | Giovanni 
                        span.gradient-text Mazzeo
                    .subheading.mb-4 Solutions Engineer · Confidential Computing, Cybersecurity & AI
                    p.lead.mb-4
                        | Technical leader and engineer with experience helping companies adopt confidential computing, building secure AI and blockchain systems, and delivering technical training. I combine hands-on architecture and software development with a track record of explaining complex technologies to engineers, researchers, and project partners.
                    p.mb-4
                        | That mix is what makes me effective as a solutions engineer: I do not only design and ship secure systems—I present them, teach them, and turn research-grade concepts into practical guidance teams can implement. I have delivered specialized cybersecurity and Trusted Execution Environment training, presented technical tutorials and papers at 15+ IEEE conferences, and coordinated technical work packages across international EU projects with diverse stakeholders.
                    p.mb-4
                        | As co-founder and senior engineer at Trust Up, I led teams supporting companies migrating applications to confidential computing environments. At Trillion, I architected Proof of Trusted Execution (PoTE) and a TEE-enabled Ethereum consensus client for high-throughput DEXs. At Credora and X-Margin, I shipped production Web3 and TEE infrastructure—from SGX-based privacy-preserving credit scoring to on-chain attestations for DeFi risk metrics.
                    p.mb-4
                        | I hold a PhD in Information Technology focused on trustworthy cloud provisioning and data-in-use protection using CPU security extensions. I am an Associate Professor of Computer Security at the University of Naples Parthenope, author of 65+ peer-reviewed publications, and have served as technical lead or work-package leader in multiple Horizon projects.
                    p.mb-5
                        | Open to solutions engineer and founding engineer roles where deep systems expertise, clear technical communication, and production delivery matter equally.
